0..66 Comment "// What a recursion over decoded values refuses. A fixpoint stages"
67..139 Comment "// the code, so a tail call that keeps the code and descends only on the"
140..216 Comment "// value it decodes stands at the code\'s own stage; and a stage marks only a"
217..290 Comment "// data type, so the decoder\'s result, a function\'s, carries none. Agda\'s"
291..368 Comment "// sized types stop at the same place: a size sits on a constructor, never on"
369..440 Comment "// what a decoder returns. The model hands the value\'s own descent to a"
441..485 Comment "// function staged on the decoded family, in"
486..534 Comment "// `../../model/universe/decoded-descent.gandr`."
535..537 Comment "//"
538..584 Comment "// - see: #2862 — `totalDirect`, `decodedAt`"
586..632 Comment "// The naturals, their addition and the lists."
633..639 Keyword "import"
640..641 StringLit "\""
641..673 StringLit "../../model/data/data-base.gandr"
673..674 StringLit "\""
